-- Persistent rotating stash manager for Pripyat Full.
-- A new world starts with 400 stashes selected from the 1236 manually approved
-- coordinates. Persistent hints may claim additional unused coordinates.
-- Only nearby or explicitly hinted stashes are materialized as server objects.

